  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advisory Support for the Future of Humanitarian Action</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide FCDO and other interested donors with both short- and medium-term strategic advice, over the course of 12 months, to inform decision making around how they should adjust to recent shocks to the humanitarian system while also advancing a more equitable, legitimate and resilient system shaped by crisis-affected actors.</narrative>
  </description>
